0-08:00","id":800987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=800984#post800984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just focus on the DSG. Both of them would be too much to absorb in one weekend anyhow.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can play pretend with the crossover chapter and the Giants in the Earth setting, I suppose.<br /> <br /> Demon STG is a book I've been ecstatic about since the announcement, but good golly if Mummy content doesn't complete overshadow everything else for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T00:34:43-08:00","id":801203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=800969#post800969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've never been more bitter about missing a Kickstarter than I am in this exact moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tell me about it. Even though my Mummy campaign has finished and my Demon campaign is about to start, it's Dreams of Avarice that I want to read the most.<br /> <br /> Probably going to need to avoid this particular forum until I can get my hands on the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T02:55:21-08:00","id":801247,"title":"","content":"I've got two questions. The first.. when you say its available to backers on Wednesday.. does that mean purchase able on Wednesday, or do backers get it for free? Second question.. if anyone can spoiler this much, is the book still an in character artifact like the CWoD's Book of Nod, or are there mechanics? I know systems we were promised, like sekhem architecture, sekhem sorcers, etc, havent showed up yet. Id love to get a book of nod style in game thing with an appendix of equinox road style endgame material, but honestly id be content with just the Dreams themselves. I mean, ive felt confident enough to have flashbacks where players remember home brewed quotes... but.. i mean... this is THE BOOK. I didnt have the fervor for the book of nod that I do for this thing, especially since the tragedy of a mummy blindly seeking apotheiosis without it is probably a dramatic story arc in many people's mummy games. PS Az, do you think you may want to run an epilogue for your groups once you get the book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T03:18:16-08:00","id":801259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=800984#post800984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Both of them would be too much to absorb in one weekend anyhow.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually dreading that very challenge when I read the news at work.<br /> <br /> <b>Mummy</b> is My Game, though. <b>Demon</b> is a good job but I still can't get into it, but the content of the Storyteller's Guide seems enough to win me over","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T03:23:10-08:00","id":801260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cleverest of Things</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=801247#post801247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got two questions. The first.. when you say its available to backers on Wednesday.. does that mean purchase able on Wednesday, or do backers get it for free? Second question.. if anyone can spoiler this much, is the book still an in character artifact like the CWoD's Book of Nod, or are there mechanics? I know systems we were promised, like sekhem architecture, sekhem sorcers, etc, havent showed up yet. Id love to get a book of nod style in game thing with an appendix of equinox road style endgame material, but honestly id be content with just the Dreams themselves. I mean, ive felt confident enough to have flashbacks where players remember home brewed quotes... but.. i mean... this is THE BOOK. I didnt have the fervor for the book of nod that I do for this thing, especially since the tragedy of a mummy blindly seeking apotheiosis without it is probably a dramatic story arc in many people's mummy games. PS Az, do you think you may want to run an epilogue for your groups once you get the book?</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably not. There was only one character with any interest in achieving Apotheosis.<br /> <br /> That said, I'll definitely be interested in running Mummy again in the future, and there's no doubt that it will be a pretty big deal. An Avarice Chronicle-esque Nome torn by the revelations of the book could be an interesting change of pace to our last game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T08:06:25-08:00","id":801394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Azahul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=801260#post801260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably not. There was only one character with any interest in achieving Apotheosis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Guest appearance?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Azahul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=801260#post801260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That said, I'll definitely be interested in running Mummy again in the future, and there's no doubt that it will be a pretty big deal. An Avarice Chronicle-esque Nome torn by the revelations of the book could be an interesting change of pace to our last game.</div> </div> </div> </div>And we'd look forward to reading it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T09:16:35-08:00","id":801442,"title":"","content":"First off: If you backed Mummy the Curse back in 2013, you get a free copy on Wednesday, where it will sit in backer hands and get erratad until it's ready for release to the public, when it will be made available in PDF and POD forms.<br /> <br /> I know it is still a in-game artifact. I have no idea if it's like the Clan books which were mostly in game artifacts with some mechanics or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T13:01:50-08:00","id":801568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=801442#post801442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off: If you backed Mummy the Curse back in 2013, you get a free copy on Wednesday, where it will sit in backer hands and get erratad until it's ready for release to the public, when it will be made available in PDF and POD forms.<br /> <br /> I know it is still a in-game artifact. I have no idea if it's like the Clan books which were mostly in game artifacts with some mechanics or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>You tease.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">characterscharacters</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T13:36:13-08:00","id":801578,"title":"","content":"I haven't actually read Dreams, mind you.<br /> <br /> Had I done so, the tease would be far worse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T17:01:53-08:00","id":801674,"title":"","content":"So I've got a problem. I back Mummy, but some time ago I forgot my password for my kickstarter account. I asked for a new password and was promised that it was randomized and sent to me. I believe half of that statement. I never got an email with the new password, however. I have likewise never gotten a response from any inquiry I've made any party that could correct the problem. I'd like to get Avarice tomorrow. Any suggestions on how?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T17:09:40-08:00","id":801681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=801674#post801674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I've got a problem. I back Mummy, but some time ago I forgot my password for my kickstarter account. I asked for a new password and was promised that it was randomized and sent to me. I believe half of that statement. I never got an email with the new password, however. I have likewise never gotten a response from any inquiry I've made any party that could correct the problem. I'd like to get Avarice tomorrow. Any suggestions on how?</div> </div> </div> </div>And of COURSE the moment I say that I go back and try it again and the password email pops up in my email without any trouble at all. NEVER MIND.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T15:37:43-08:00","id":802391,"title":"","content":"*looks up from excited reading* Sweet mate, hope you got everything worked out!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T16:52:00-08:00","id":802451,"title":"","content":"I am only a few pages in and I love it already. The introduction was very evocative and a bit sad (I got the feeling Hani Youssef didnt survive long), and that first page with all the warnings was so brilliant and eerie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T17:28:57-08:00","id":802477,"title":"","content":"That introduction was brilliant. Is it wrong that I really want to play a No-Name Group chronicle now?<br /> <br /> EDIT: I'm so glad to see the &quot;Minoans were the Sea Peoples&quot; theory in a Mummy book. Had an entire game planned around that very idea!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 01-06-2016, 08:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T17:35:41-08:00","id":802485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/590081-dreams-of-avarice?p=802477#post802477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That introduction was brilliant. Is it wrong that I really want to play a No-Name Group chronicle now?<br /> <br /> EDIT: I'm so glad to see the &amp;quot;Minoans were the Sea Peoples&amp;quot; theory in a Mummy book. Had an entire game planned around that very idea!</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, I thought you weren't a backer? How do you have